+The shared HTTP transport lives in the installed `lib/http.mjs` module. It applies the connector's
+15-second timeout, refuses redirects, parses responses through `lib/protocol.mjs`, and retries only
+transient server or rate-limit failures with bounded `Retry-After` delays and exponential backoff.
+Pairing, reconciliation, usage upload, doctor, and disconnect use this same transport; endpoint
+methods, request bodies, headers, and protocol validation remain defined by their existing CLI and
+protocol layers.
+
